IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-validity`
IMPORT `g2-conditions`
IMPORT `g2-temporary-licence`
IMPORT `g2-renewal`
IMPORT `g2-tests-fixtures`

-- g2-tests-renewal.l4: tests of the second limb of section 8 and of "the conditions of the licence still hold" (IP18).
-- Expected values decided from the Hebrew of s 8 and s 10(a)(2) before any module was run.

GIVETH A Applicant
`an adult citizen with no training at all` MEANS `an applicant with nothing`

GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH AN Application
`a renewal application by` applicant MEANS
    Application WITH
        `the applicant` IS applicant
        `the kind of licence sought` IS `grade 1 licence`
        `an application to renew` IS TRUE
        `an application for a temporary licence` IS FALSE
        `the day of the application` IS `the usual application day`

§ `Tests — s 8, the second limb: renewal on the conditions of s 6 except s 6(a)(4)`

-- src:100 | {{ח:ת}} תוקפו של רישיון יהיה לחמש שנים או עד 31 במרץ של השנה החמישית מהשנה שבה ניתן הרישיון, לפי המוקדם (להלן – תקופת תוקף), וניתן לחדשו לתקופות תוקף נוספות בהתקיים התנאים לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף 6}}, למעט התנאי לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|סעיף קטן (א)(4) של אותו סעיף}}.
-- The applicant with no training at all can be renewed on (1) to (3), though the full s 6(a) conditions fail for the same person (the (4) is not asked).
#ASSERT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(a) — the conditions (1) to (4) all hold` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) `the commencement day in the tests` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
-- (1), (2) and (3) are asked as in s 6.
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` FALSE `, citizen` TRUE `, resident` TRUE `, with the record` `a clean record`)) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` TRUE `, citizen` FALSE `, resident` FALSE `, with the record` `a clean record`)) FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` TRUE `, citizen` FALSE `, resident` TRUE `, with the record` `a clean record`)) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` TRUE `, citizen` TRUE `, resident` TRUE `, with the record` (`a record showing criminal conviction` TRUE `criminal charge pending` FALSE `and disciplinary conviction` FALSE))) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8 — the licence can be renewed for the applicant` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` TRUE `, citizen` TRUE `, resident` TRUE `, with the record` (`a record showing criminal conviction` TRUE `criminal charge pending` FALSE `and disciplinary conviction` FALSE))) FALSE

-- FR1 (trap T26), the alternative: s 8 read as a duty, displaced only by a ground under s 10(a).
-- Eligible and no ground: the duty stands; a ground applies: no duty; not eligible: no duty.
#TRACE `s 8 (read as a duty) — the Registrar must renew the licence` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
#TRACE `s 8 (read as a duty) — the Registrar must renew the licence` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Registrar` DOES `grant the licence sought` `grade 1 licence` AT 9
#TRACE `s 8 (read as a duty) — the Registrar must renew the licence` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
#TRACE `s 8 (read as a duty) — the Registrar must renew the licence` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` FALSE `, citizen` TRUE `, resident` TRUE `, with the record` `a clean record`)) FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)

§ `Tests — s 10(a)(2) with ss 6 and 9: the conditions of the licence still hold`

-- A licence under s 6: the conditions (1) to (3) as for renewal.  A licence under s 9: the conditions of s 9(a).
-- src:103 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} על אף האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיפים 6}} {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 8|ו־8}}, הרשם רשאי לתת רישיון דרגה 3 זמני, למבקש ממדינת חוץ שמתקיימים לגביו התנאים המנויים להלן (בסעיף זה – מומחה זר), לתקופה שלא תעלה על שנה (בסעיף זה – רישיון זמני):
#ASSERT `the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold` (`a renewal application by` `an adult citizen with no training at all`) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the conditions of a licence under section 6 still hold` (`a renewal application by` (`an applicant who is adult` TRUE `, citizen` FALSE `, resident` FALSE `, with the record` `a clean record`)) FALSE
#ASSERT `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` `a qualifying foreign expert` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` `a qualifying foreign expert` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the conditions of a licence under section 9 still hold` (`a foreign expert invited for a system of` 70 `kW, authorised being` TRUE `, from abroad being` TRUE `, with work` (LIST (`a piece of work abroad on` (YMD 2024 5 1) `, similar being` TRUE))) TRUE
-- The dispatcher: which of the two sets of conditions answers for the licence at hand.
#ASSERT `the conditions of the licence still hold` (`an ordinary grade 1 licence granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1)) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the conditions of the licence still hold` (`an ordinary grade 1 licence granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1)) FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `the conditions of the licence still hold` (`a licence of kind` `grade 3 licence` `, temporary being` TRUE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (YMD 2027 1 31)) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING) FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the conditions of the licence still hold` (`a licence of kind` `grade 3 licence` `, temporary being` TRUE `, granted on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, renewed on` EMPTY `, recorded to end` (JUST (YMD 2027 1 31)) `, revoked` NOTHING `, suspended from` NOTHING `, suspended until` NOTHING) TRUE FALSE
